{"id":9240,"date":"2023-03-07T12:55:03","date_gmt":"2023-03-07T20:55:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/?post_type=lesson&#038;p=9240"},"modified":"2024-08-13T19:40:51","modified_gmt":"2024-08-14T02:40:51","slug":"0-1-introduction-to-codrone-edu-2","status":"publish","type":"lesson","link":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/0-1-introduction-to-codrone-edu-2\/","title":{"rendered":"0.1: Introduction to CoDrone EDU"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2212d3ca644\" name=\"6a2212d3ca644\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 1<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Welcome to CoDrone EDU!<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]What is CoDrone EDU? And why is it the best platform for you to learn all about drones and programming?[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;6222&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<p>CoDrone EDU is the newest programmable drone by Robolink! Built just for students like you, CoDrone EDU is fully equipped with all the sensors and features you need to learn all about drones while programming in Python. The possibilities of what you can build are endless!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;6223&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;6224&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2212d3ca778\" name=\"6a2212d3ca778\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 2<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Watch the Introductory Video<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_video link=&#8221;https:\/\/youtu.be\/5r5xsG97y-o&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2212d3ca9f9\" name=\"6a2212d3ca9f9\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 3<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>CoDrone EDU Specifications and Features<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Specifications:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Size: 138.5 x 138.5\u00a0 x\u00a0 34.8 mm<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Weight: 54.8 grams<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Battery: 3.7v 530mAh<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Continuous flight time: 7-8 minutes (on a complete charge)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Charge time: 60 minutes<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Maximum Velocity: 2.5 meters per second\u00a0 (9km\/h)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Communication Protocol: 2.4 GHz radio communication<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Range: 50 meters<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sensors:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3-axis gyroscope and accelerometer<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">barometer<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 color sensors<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2 infrared range finders (front and bottom)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">optical flow (for position)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Features:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Auto-hovering and stabilization<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Programmable RGB LEDs on the drone and controller<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Programmable buzzer on the drone and controller<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2212d3caad2\" name=\"6a2212d3caad2\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 4<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>What's in the Box?<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Here is what should be in your CoDrone EDU box. Please check that you have all your pieces before you continue.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>User guide (available digitally <a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1p6ps1-LN93M0F-kF19DffVnjkl-K5QaO\/view?usp=sharing\">here<\/a>)<\/li>\n<li>CoDrone EDU<\/li>\n<li>Smart Controller<\/li>\n<li>2 x drone batteries<\/li>\n<li>1 x drone battery dual-charger<\/li>\n<li>1 x Micro USB cable (may be black or red)<\/li>\n<li>8 x color cards<\/li>\n<li>4 x extra propellers<\/li>\n<li>1 x propeller remover<\/li>\n<li>Screwdriver and bolt for controller battery pack<\/li>\n<li>Set of labels for drone and controller<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;9452&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2212d3cab76\" name=\"6a2212d3cab76\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 5<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Review<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Let&#8217;s review! You should have:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Watched the introductory video<\/li>\n<li>Read about the technical specifications, sensors, and features for CoDrone EDU<\/li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Unboxed CoDrone EDU and checked the parts list<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>In the next lesson, you will go through a pre-flight checklist to safely prepare for flight.[\/vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"[vc_row][vc_column] Step 6 Welcome to CoDrone EDU! [vc_column_text]What is CoDrone EDU? And why is it the best platform for you to learn all about drones and programming?[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=\"6222\" img_size=\"full\" alignment=\"center\"][vc_column_text]&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/0-1-introduction-to-codrone-edu-2\/\">&hellip;<\/a>","protected":false},"featured_media":9813,"template":"","meta":{"_initial_content":"","_new_post":false,"_quiz_has_questions":false,"_lesson_complexity":"easy","_lesson_length":10,"_lesson_course":9219,"_lesson_preview":"preview"},"lesson-category":[],"lesson-tag":[4328,2174,2177,2109],"class_list":["post-9240","lesson","type-lesson","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","lesson-tag-cde","lesson-tag-coding","lesson-tag-getting-started","lesson-tag-introduction","module-getting-started","post","odd"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/9240","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/lesson"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/9240\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":12487,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/9240\/revisions\/12487"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/9813"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-js